---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
{% set prefix = "/en" if lang == "en" else "" %}
<main id="main-content">
  <section class="home-hero" style="--hero-image: url('/images/web/product-parts.jpg')">
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">CUSTOM INDUSTRIAL KNIVES / 01</span>
        <h1>{% if lang == "en" %}From drawing or sample to repeatable blade production.{% else %}从图纸、样品<br>到稳定批量。{% endif %}</h1>
        <p>{% if lang == "en" %}Custom machine knives for woodworking, food processing, plastic recycling, paper converting, textile and special-purpose equipment, supported by heat treatment, grinding, machining and inspection.{% else %}面向木工、食品、塑胶回收、纸品、纺织与专用设备，提供材料建议、热处理、精密研磨、机加工、检测和批量交付。{% endif %}</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-dark" href="{{ prefix }}/rfq/">{% if lang == "en" %}Send drawing for review{% else %}提交图纸询价{% endif %}</a>
          <a class="button button-outline" href="{{ prefix }}/products/">{% if lang == "en" %}Browse product directory{% else %}浏览产品目录{% endif %}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav class="hero-index" aria-label="{% if lang == 'en' %}RFQ entry paths{% else %}询价入口{% endif %}">
        <a href="{{ prefix }}/rfq/#drawing"><b>01</b><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Drawing-based{% else %}来图定制{% endif %}</span></a>
        <a href="{{ prefix }}/rfq/#sample"><b>02</b><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Sample matching{% else %}来样复刻{% endif %}</span></a>
        <a href="{{ prefix }}/rfq/#application"><b>03</b><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Application review{% else %}工况选型{% endif %}</span></a>
        <a href="{{ prefix }}/quality/"><b>04</b><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Batch consistency{% else %}批量一致性{% endif %}</span></a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <div class="proof-strip" aria-label="{% if lang == 'en' %}Manufacturing facts{% else %}制造事实{% endif %}">
      <div class="proof-item"><strong>40+</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Years of group cutting-tool background{% else %}集团工业刀具行业背景{% endif %}</span></div>
      <div class="proof-item"><strong>1990</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Shenzhen production base established{% else %}深圳生产基地成立{% endif %}</span></div>
      <div class="proof-item"><strong>ISO</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}9001:2015 quality system{% else %}9001:2015 质量体系{% endif %}</span></div>
      <div class="proof-item"><strong>3</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Drawing, sample and application paths{% else %}图纸、样品与工况入口{% endif %}</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">PRODUCT DIRECTORY</span><h2>{% if lang == "en" %}Find the blade family by equipment and application.{% else %}按设备与应用找到刀具类别。{% endif %}</h2></div>
        <p>{% if lang == "en" %}Each product page connects the blade type to typical equipment, manufacturing focus and the information needed for quotation review.{% else %}每个产品页把刀型对应到典型设备、制造关注点和询价所需资料。{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="product-grid">
        {% for product in catalog.products %}
          {% include "partials/product-card.njk" %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="section-actions"><a class="button button-dark" href="{{ prefix }}/products/">{% if lang == "en" %}Open all product pages{% else %}进入完整产品目录{% endif %}</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">RFQ ENTRY PATHS</span><h2>{% if lang == "en" %}Start with the information you already have.{% else %}从你已经掌握的资料开始。{% endif %}</h2></div>
        <p>{% if lang == "en" %}A complete drawing is helpful but not required for the first discussion. Samples, photos and equipment conditions can also start the review.{% else %}首次沟通不一定要有完整图纸；样品、照片和设备工况同样可以启动评估。{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="route-grid">
        <article class="route-item"><span class="route-number">01 / DRAWING</span><h3>{% if lang == "en" %}Drawing-based manufacturing{% else %}来图定制{% endif %}</h3><p>{% if lang == "en" %}Send dimensions, tolerance, material, quantity and the drawing revision used for quotation.{% else %}提供尺寸、公差、材料、数量和图纸版本，进入报价评估。{% endif %}</p></article>
        <article class="route-item"><span class="route-number">02 / SAMPLE</span><h3>{% if lang == "en" %}Sample matching{% else %}来样复刻{% endif %}</h3><p>{% if lang == "en" %}An old blade, sample or clear photos help confirm mounting, edge geometry and failure pattern.{% else %}旧刀、样品或清晰照片可用于确认安装、刃口和失效现象。{% endif %}</p></article>
        <article class="route-item"><span class="route-number">03 / APPLICATION</span><h3>{% if lang == "en" %}Application review{% else %}按工况选型{% endif %}</h3><p>{% if lang == "en" %}Review the machine, material cut, operating frequency and life target before defining the route.{% else %}按设备、被切材料、使用频率和寿命目标确认制造路线。{% endif %}</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-system">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">ENGINEERING SYSTEM</span><h2>{% if lang == "en" %}Connect requirements to a controlled manufacturing route.{% else %}让需求对应可控制的制造路线。{% endif %}</h2></div>
        <p>{% if lang == "en" %}Capabilities are presented by what they control and how they support sample validation and repeat production.{% else %}制造能力按照“控制什么、如何支撑样品验证和重复生产”来表达。{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="system-panel">
        <div class="system-rows">
          {% for capability in catalog.capabilities %}
          <div class="system-row"><strong>{{ capability.code }}</strong><p>{{ capability.summary[lang] }}</p><a href="{{ prefix }}/capabilities/{{ capability.slug }}/">{% if lang == "en" %}OPEN{% else %}查看{% endif %}</a></div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <div class="system-media"><img src="/images/web/product-parts.jpg" alt="{% if lang == 'en' %}Finished industrial blade components{% else %}工业刀具成品零件{% endif %}" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1280"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">QUALITY CONTROL</span><h2>{% if lang == "en" %}Inspection throughout the manufacturing route.{% else %}检测贯穿制造过程。{% endif %}</h2></div>
        <p>{% if lang == "en" %}Spectrometry, coordinate measurement, image measurement and metallography support material, dimensional and process checks.{% else %}光谱、三坐标、影像测量与金相设备，为材料、尺寸和过程检查提供支持。{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="quality-preview">
        <figure><img src="/images/quality/spectrolab-spectrometer.jpeg" alt="SPECTROLAB spectrometer" loading="lazy" width="1269" height="846"><figcaption>{% if lang == "en" %}SPECTROLAB spectrometer / material analysis{% else %}SPECTROLAB 光谱仪 / 材料分析{% endif %}</figcaption></figure>
        <figure><img src="/images/quality/cmm-beyond-apex707.jpeg" alt="Mitutoyo BEYOND APEX 707 CMM" loading="lazy" width="1269" height="1903"><figcaption>{% if lang == "en" %}Mitutoyo BEYOND APEX 707 / dimensional inspection{% else %}三丰 BEYOND APEX 707 / 尺寸检测{% endif %}</figcaption></figure>
        <figure><img src="/images/quality/keyence-im7000.jpeg" alt="KEYENCE IM-7000 image measurement system" loading="lazy" width="1269" height="846"><figcaption>{% if lang == "en" %}KEYENCE IM-7000 / image dimension measurement{% else %}基恩士 IM-7000 / 影像尺寸测量{% endif %}</figcaption></figure>
      </div>
      <div class="quality-points">
        <div class="quality-point"><strong>ISO 9001:2015</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Quality management system{% else %}质量管理体系{% endif %}</span></div>
        <div class="quality-point"><strong>{% if lang == "en" %}Material review{% else %}材料确认{% endif %}</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Connect material choice to the intended application{% else %}把材料选择对应到实际应用{% endif %}</span></div>
        <div class="quality-point"><strong>{% if lang == "en" %}Dimensional inspection{% else %}尺寸检测{% endif %}</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Review fit, geometry and drawing requirements{% else %}核对安装、几何和图纸要求{% endif %}</span></div>
        <div class="quality-point"><strong>{% if lang == "en" %}Batch records{% else %}批次记录{% endif %}</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Support repeat production against approved criteria{% else %}按确认标准支撑重复生产{% endif %}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="section-actions"><a class="button button-outline" href="{{ prefix }}/quality/">{% if lang == "en" %}Review the quality system{% else %}查看质量体系{% endif %}</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="factory-band" style="--factory-image: url('/images/web/factory-building.jpg')">
    <div class="container factory-band-inner">
      <span class="eyebrow">MODERN FACTORY / GROUP BACKGROUND</span>
      <h2>{% if lang == "en" %}A new Zhangzhou base backed by long-term cutting-tool experience.{% else %}以长期工业刀具经验，承接漳州新基地。{% endif %}</h2>
      <p>{% if lang == "en" %}Qunxin Industrial was established in Zhangzhou in 2024 under the Wei Qun industrial group, continuing the group’s manufacturing background in industrial knives and cutting tools.{% else %}群新工业于 2024 年在福建漳州成立，承接伟群工业集团在工业刀具和切削工具领域的制造经验。{% endif %}</p>
      <div class="factory-facts">
        <div class="factory-fact"><strong>40+</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Years of group background{% else %}集团行业背景{% endif %}</span></div>
        <div class="factory-fact"><strong>1990</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Shenzhen base established{% else %}深圳基地成立{% endif %}</span></div>
        <div class="factory-fact"><strong>2024</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Zhangzhou Qunxin established{% else %}漳州群新成立{% endif %}</span></div>
        <div class="factory-fact"><strong>ISO</strong><span>9001:2015</span></div>
      </div>
      <a class="button button-outline" href="{{ prefix }}/company/">{% if lang == "en" %}View company and bases{% else %}查看公司与基地{% endif %}</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">CUSTOMER REFERENCES</span><h2>{% if lang == "en" %}Industrial brands and equipment applications served.{% else %}服务过的工业品牌与设备应用。{% endif %}</h2></div>
        <p>{% if lang == "en" %}Experience across different blade families supports collaboration with brands, equipment makers and industrial users.{% else %}覆盖多类刀具的制造经验，支持与品牌、设备商及工业用户开展项目协作。{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="logo-wall">
        {% for logo in ["kam", "eastman", "sata", "stanley", "baird-medical", "tti", "jwei", "lectra", "bullmer", "fiskars"] %}
        <div class="logo-item"><img src="/images/logos/{{ logo }}.png" alt="{{ logo }} logo" loading="lazy"></div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% include "partials/rfq-cta.njk" %}
</main>
